<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Just captivate me.</l><l>Lord, draw me closer to You.</l><l>And win me fully</l><l>To run after You.</l><l>Just seeking You and only You.</l><l>Lord, You’re my goal and focus too.</l><l>Lord, I treasure You.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
